      "review_description": "After some prior product investigation from the three quotes received I decided to choose Vagus Energy to manage our solar installation. National manager Vlad, who was my initial contact and the Vagus projects team were wonderful to deal with answering the many questions I had and registering my Solar Victoria application and pre and post Distributor approval/connection leaving me a simple rebate application to complete. I was very pleased with the standard of work by electrical contractor N G Cabling Solutions who completed the installation on behalf of Vagus Energy, they were punctual, polite, tidy and took the time to connect and explain my remote reading home kit.My only comment for those considering a solar system is that dealing with multiple parties does take some time so be patient and enjoy the savings.",
