      "review_description": "Vladimir did a great job quoting - very efficient, answered all my questions and changed various bits to suit my requirements - site and budget constraints.  Provided excellent guidance to navigate the rebate process, and kept me updated as to when each stage of the process would happen.The installers (Peninsula Sparkys?) were really professional - on time, tidy and knew their stuff.  Happy to answer my questions, asked me where I would like the inverter to go, gave me advanced warning as to when the power would be off etc.  Great communicators - would have them back to do other work any day.The grid connect went smoothly and we started exporting our excess to the grid the following week.Very happy customer, thank you to all involved",
